{"crw-nogi-12128":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"どーもーヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/05/24/0586541/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近学校に行くとどうしても\n授業中白目になったり\n頭をグラングランさせてしまう～(-ω-；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あえて居眠りしてるとは\n言わないでおきます♪(ﾉ･･)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それをポジティブと言うか\n開き直りと言うかはあなた次第っ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってことでその分6枚目のCDが\n素敵なものになると思うので\n期待しちゃっててください｀‐ω‐´)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぁ～最近握手会がないから\nみなさん不足だよー(´°ω°｀)もぉっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く会ってお話ししたり\nぎゅーっ♡てしたいヽ(〃v〃)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7月が待ち遠しいですね～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば今日は二期生ちゃんが\n私たちのレッスンをちょこっと\n見学しに来ましたヽ(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ変な緊張感があって\nなんだかドキドキしたよ(OωO )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/05/24/0586541/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまーい♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあまなったんと\nおしゃべりtime(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ♡\nいきましょー♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q真夏さんは1億円の貯金があるお見合い相手と一文無しの自分が好きな人、結婚するならどっちですが?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A一文無し...じゃあ困るけど\nやっぱり結婚は大好きな人と\nしたいなぁヽ(〃v〃)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ先だけど\nウエディングドレスとか\n憧れちゃう(ﾉ･v･)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q真夏は色んな職業を夢見てたっぽいけど、今までどんな仕事を夢見ましたか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ケーキ屋さん\nお花屋さん\nアナウンサー\nネイリスト\n家庭科の先生\n音楽の先生\n女優さん\n洋服のショップ店員さん\nキャビンアテンダント"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"などなど♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q真夏は怒るとどんな感じになるのー？弟君とけんかとかするときなどに(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A私あんまり怒らないかも☆\nでも怒った時は物の扱いが\nちょっとガサツになっちゃう(ﾟ-ﾟ；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qよかったら真夏ちゃんがよく使う顔文字教えて下さい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ←これは定番♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏＝(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q女子会は何食べたん？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A若月と玲香とのかな？\nしゃぶしゃぶ食べましたよ∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美味しかった～♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私お鍋系大好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q真夏が好きな人に食べさせたい料理は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aこれ結構じっくり考えちゃった♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりクリームコロッケは\n食べてもらいたいなぁ(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとはデザートにタルトも♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qまなったんて足は早かった？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A50mで10秒ちょいくらいかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"速い？遅い？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普通がどのくらいか\nわかんない_(┐「ε:)_"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんどのくらいなのー？♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q好きだった科目と嫌いだった科目教えてー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A好きなのは家庭科と国語と社会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嫌いなのは数学と化学"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見ての通り真夏は完全なる\n文系なのですヽ(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q真夏ちゃんの好きな飲み物は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも飲むのは\n水かお茶が多いよ(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マカロンとかケーキが好きな分\n甘い飲み物はあんまり飲まない☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q真夏ちゃんは個別握手会だと小悪魔になるから、「個握魔」って呼んでる人がいるそうなんだけど、この呼び名はどう思いますか？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aえぇ～っ(OωO )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どう思うかの前にまずこれ考えた人\nネーミングセンスあるなぁ♪\nって思っちゃったヾ(-ω-*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小悪魔になってるのかなぁ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも真夏の握手に名前\nつけてもらえてちょこっと\n嬉しい∩^ω^∩♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏にしかできない握手をもっと\n研究したくなりますな(人-ω-)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はいっ♪お知らせ～(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今発売中のsamuraiELOに\n出させてもらってまーす♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お洋服大好きだし嬉しいです∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"連載の美女散歩にも\n出させていただいてるので\nぜひCHECKしてくださいヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目印は生田の表紙だからねっヽ(〃v〃)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"弟がよくELO読んでるから\n買ってきてもらおーっと♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃ、明日も早いので\nお風呂はいって来まーすヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉぽわ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/05/24/0586541/0002.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-9061":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/07/1510978/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/07/1510978/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぺふぺふ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんです！ぺふぺふ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風邪を引いて声がぺふぺふになっちゃったよ～(っω・`。)泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は筆談とかして乗り切った/ _ ;\nのど痛いよ～のどがぺふぺふしてるよ～（ ;  ; ）"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/07/1510978/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、頑張る＞_＜！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"光の速さで治すから大丈夫っ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんも、ぺふぺふならないように\n気をつけてねっ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/07/1510978/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/07/1510978/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな今日も、色んな撮影をしたよ～＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず、まいやんと まいまいと、\nFLASHさんの撮影をしました(*^_^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/0